{"overview":"علی که کفش کهنه و تعمیر شده خواهرش زهرا را از کفاش محل گرفته، آن را در بازگشت به خانه گم می‌کند. او برای آن که این اتفاق در زندگی نامطلوب اقتصادی‌شان خللی ایجاد نکند، مخفیانه با خواهرش قرار می‌گذارد تا نوبتی از کفش کتانی خودش استفاده کنند. در همین گیر و دار علی عزمش را جزم می‌کند تا در مسابقه دو و میدانی مدارس شرکت کند و به جایزه نفر سوم (یک جفت کفش ورزشی) دست یابد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Zohre's shoes are gone; her older brother Ali lost them. They are poor, there are no shoes for Zohre until they come up with an idea: they will share one pair of shoes. School awaits.","tagline_en":"A Little Secret... Their Biggest Adventure!","runtime":88,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["مجید مجیدی"],"crew_en":["Majid Majidi"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"Amir Farrokh Hashemian","role":"Ali","photo":""},{"name":"Bahare Seddiqi","role":"Zahra","photo":""},{"name":"Nafise Jafar-Mohammadi","role":"Roya","photo":""},{"name":"رضا ناجی","role":"Ali's Father","photo":"/lO7H6c1ArDhS6WYvDPnz9meQtLW.jpg","en":"Reza Naji"},{"name":"Fereshte Sarabandi","role":"Ali's Mother","photo":""},{"name":"Kamal Mirkarimi","role":"Assistant","photo":""},{"name":"Behzad Rafi","role":"Trainer","photo":""},{"name":"Dariush Mokhtari","role":"Ali's Teacher","photo":""},{"name":"Mohammad-Hasan Hosseinian","role":"Roya's Father","photo":""},{"name":"Masume Dair","role":"Roya's Mother","photo":""},{"name":"Kambiz Peykarnegar","role":"Race Organizer","photo":""},{"name":"Hasan Roohparvari","role":"Race Photographer","photo":""}],"trailer":"dqxvZeQsVzY","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/21334/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Kanopy","kind":"free","logo":"/cltb8XKan9ierp23ItPmCOcVLRa.png"},{"n":"Hoopla","kind":"free","logo":"/gtjNBzAoGgUtYzt0UKXmwG34WWL.png"},{"n":"YouTube Free","kind":"ads","logo":"/gqaJWT5oFiJyVDojVLYRSFPbhQ1.png"},{"n":"JustWatch TV","kind":"rent","logo":"/aJXLTvX11u4fBLMPRVJZVKkLYHP.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"rent","logo